olve bare host copy destinations against the current dir by @Jackmeson1 in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1936\n* fix(sandbox): recover interrupted creation cleanup by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1929\n* fix(filesystem): translate guest sparse seek modes on macos by @appcypher in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1831\n* fix(release): enable keyring in cli builds by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1976\n### Documentation\n* docs(quickstart): select cloud explicitly and clean up by @TheRealSibasishBehera in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1958\n### Dependencies\n* chore(deps): Bump the \"dependencies\" group with 2 updates across multiple ecosystems by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1961\n### Maintenance\n* chore: refresh lockfiles after v0.7.11 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1933\n* chore(release): bump microsandbox to 0.7.12 by @appcypher in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1949\n\n## New Contributors\n* @juleszimmermann made their first contribution in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1926\n* @Jackmeson1 made their first contribution in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1944\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/compare/v0.7.11...v0.7.12","reactions":{"total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":7}
